@startuml Booking_Studio_Sequence

title Sequence Diagram - Booking Studio

actor User
participant "Studio Booking Form" as View
participant "StudioBookingController" as Controller
database DB
participant "Email Service" as Mail

User -> View: Buka form booking
View -> Controller: create()
Controller -> DB: Ambil data ketersediaan sesi
DB --> Controller: Data sesi
Controller --> View: Tampilkan form dan jadwal

User -> View: Isi form booking
View -> Controller: store(request)
Controller -> Controller: Validasi input dan cek sesi
Controller -> DB: Simpan booking pending
DB --> Controller: Berhasil
Controller -> Mail: Kirim notifikasi booking
Mail --> User: Email konfirmasi
Controller --> View: Redirect ke halaman sukses

@enduml